Hi {Owner},

I build websites and patient software for cosmetic surgery and aesthetic clinics. {Business Name} has strong work, but on a phone the procedure pages are slow, the surgeons share one page and pricing says contact us.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting first: a page per procedure, a page per surgeon, a gallery layout with consent rules, fee ranges and a private virtual consult, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it fits, I finish it on your domain for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, security and edits. It makes no result promises, and every page is approved by your surgeons before launch. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Would thirty minutes with you and the lead surgeon be worth it?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

